<title>USA: Mid Ocean Ltd completes Brockbank merger.</title>
<headline>Mid Ocean Ltd completes Brockbank merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid Ocean Ltd, a reinsurer, said on Tuesday that it had completed its acquisition of Brockbank Group, accepting valid tenders for more than 90 percent of the outstanding shares in Brockbank.</p>
<p>In addition, Mid Ocean said the offer will remain open until 1500 London time on September 15.</p>
<p>Mid Ocean estimated the total cost of acquiring all outstanding shares of Brockbank at 85.6 million pounds sterling in cash, loan notes and the issuance of Mid Ocean ordinary shares.</p>
<p>Brockbank Group shares are traded in London on the Alternative Investment Market.</p>
</text>
